# Cursor Rules for Burgers.exe

Refer to GEMINI.md and AGENTS.md for full context.

- Trigger: When user writes `Burgers.exe`, activate context and check status.
- Base branch: `preview` or `v3` (NEVER touch `main`).
- No new npm dependencies without explicit instruction.
- Aesthetic: Premium Casual (light-first `#F5F2EE`, green `#16A34A`, Inter font).
- Verification: `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` must always pass.
